+/*
+Backprop for Gemm + Softmax + Gemm fused operation, where forward prop is defined as:
+
+  Y_g_m_o = Softmax(alpha * Q_g_m_k * K_g_k_n) * V_g_n_o
+
+Computation graph:
+
+          K^T                   V
+          |                     |
+          |                     |
+    Q --- * ----- Softmax ----- * --> Y
+              S             P
+
+Kernel inputs:
+
+    Q, K, V, Y, dY, per-row softmax stats (LSE)
+
+Kernel outputs:
+
+    dQ, dK, dV
+
+*/
